cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the associated numerical data, please cite the archived software release and the associated manuscript."
type: software

title: "Numerical code and data for thin-layer asymptotics for diffusion through coatings with time-dependent diffusivity"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT

authors:
  - given-names: Fadoua
    family-names: Boudrari
    affiliation: "The UM6P Vanguard Center, Mohammed VI Polytechnic University, Rabat, Morocco"

abstract: >-
  Numerical code, verification data, and resolved-reduced computational
  results supporting the manuscript "Thin-layer asymptotics for diffusion
  through coatings with time-dependent diffusivity: derivation and numerical
  assessment of an effective interface model." The repository contains
  manufactured-solution verification, planar decreasing-thickness
  resolved-reduced comparisons, numerical-resolution audits, and a
  circular-granule comparison for the leading effective Robin interface model.

keywords:
  - thin-layer asymptotics
  - diffusion
  - effective interface models
  - Robin interface conditions
  - time-dependent diffusivity
  - finite element method
  - resolved-reduced comparison